            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This 70-year-old female patient presented with a painful paresis of her left leg. After one year with several hospital stays, numerous radiological examinations, multimodal pain treatment and three surgeries performed, the diagnosis was made on the basis of a neurological examination.</AbstractText>
